Sanad — SIRH Algérie
====================

This product is a modified version of Horilla HRMS.

Upstream project: https://github.com/horilla/horilla-hr
Upstream copyright: see the copyright notices in the source files and LICENSE.

Sanad is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
