Modifications made in this fork include: an Algerian payroll engine (SNMG,
CNAS, IRG, TFPC/TAPP, CASNOS) driven by effective-dated parameter rows,
Decimal money handling, CSV formula-injection protection, transactional
payroll and leave generation, French/Arabic interface work, and product
branding (Sanad).

